<h1><span data-field="title" data-format="default">mouse_lastbutton</span></h1>
<p>This variable returns the last mouse button that was pressed and can return any of the special <a href="Mouse_Input.htm">mouse constants</a> except <span class="inline">mb_any</span> (you may also set this variable to one of the constants).</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Syntax:</h4>
<p class="code"><span data-field="title" data-format="default">mouse_lastbutton</span></p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Returns:</h4>
<p class="code"><span data-keyref="Type_Constant_Mouse_Button"><a target="_blank" href="mouse_check_button.htm">Mouse Button Constant</a></span> (except mb_any)</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Example:</h4>
<p class="code">if (mouse_lastbutton == mb_left)<br/>
{<br/>
    x -= 1;<br/>
}</p>
<p>This code moves the current instance left if the last button pressed was the left mouse button.</p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>
